ata-lemma=\"Valerius\">VALERIO</span><span data-text=\"Constantino\" data-n=\"60\" data-lemma=\"Constantinus\">CONSTANTINO</span><span data-text=\"maximo\" data-n=\"70\" data-lemma=\"magnus\">MAXIMO</span><span data-text=\"pio\" data-n=\"75\" data-lemma=\"pius\">PIO</span><span data-text=\"felici\" data-n=\"85\" data-lemma=\"felix\">FELICI</span><span data-text=\"invicto\" data-n=\"95\" data-lemma=\"invictus\">INVICTO</span><span data-text=\"Augusto\" data-n=\"105\" data-lemma=\"Augustus\">AUGUSTO</span><span data-text=\"Betitius\" data-n=\"110\" data-lemma=\"Betitius\">BETITIUS</span><span data-text=\"Perpetuus\" data-n=\"120\" data-lemma=\"Perpetuus\">PERPETUUS</span><span data-text=\"vir\" data-n=\"125\" data-lemma=\"vir\">VIR</span><span data-text=\"clarissimus\" data-n=\"135\" data-lemma=\"clarus\">CLARISSIMUS</span><span data-text=\"corrector\" data-n=\"145\" data-lemma=\"corrector\">CORRECTOR</span><span data-text=\"provinciae\" data-n=\"155\" data-lemma=\"provincia\">PROVINCIAE</span><span data-text=\"Siciliae\" data-n=\"165\" data-lemma=\"Sicilia\">SICILIAE</span><span data-text=\"devotus\" data-n=\"170\" data-lemma=\"devoveo\">DEVOTUS</span><span data-text=\"numini\" data-n=\"180\" data-lemma=\"numen\">NUMINI</span><span data-text=\"maiestatique\" data-n=\"185\" data-lemma=\"maiestas\">MAIESTATIQUE</span><span data-text=\"eius\" data-n=\"195\" data-lemma=\"is\">EIUS</span><span data-text=\"semper\" data-n=\"200\" data-lemma=\"semper\">SEMPER</span><span data-text=\"dicatus\" data-n=\"210\" data-lemma=\"dico\">DICATUS</span></span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic000484_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic000484_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000484.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana\" src=\"ISic000484-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>text of CIL</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>Italian translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5677-4679\">Alessandra Rocchetti</a></p>  <p>Al più moderato e vittorioso, nostro signore Flavio Valerio Costantino, massimo, pio, fortunato, indomito, augusto, Betizio Perpetuo, vir clarissimus, governatore della provincia di Sicilia, sempre devoto al suo Genio e alla sua autorità, ha dedicato (questo)</p>  </div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5677-4679\">Alessandra Rocchetti</a></p>  <p>To the most merciful and victorious, our lord Flavius Valerius Constantinus, the greatest, pious, fortunate, unconquered, augustus, Betitius Perpetuus, vir clarissimus, governor of the Sicilian province, always faithful to his Genius and authority, dedicated (this)</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li></li><li> Gualtherus 1624 226 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002388\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002388</a>  </li><li> Gualtherus 1624 [1625] 123 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931</a>  </li><li> Mommsen 1883 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/books/CILv10pII1883\" target=\"_blank\">7204</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Common